         </dc:creator>
         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The NST3904DP6T5G device is a spinâˆ’off of our popular SOTâˆ’23/SOTâˆ’323/SOTâˆ’563 threeâˆ’leaded device. It is designed for general purpose amplifier applications and is housed in the SOTâˆ’963 sixâˆ’leaded surface mount package. By putting two discrete devices in one package, this device is ideal for lowâˆ’power surface mount applications where board space is at a premium.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:description>
         <xmpMM:DocumentID>uuid:81fb5e3a-9d74-42c3-bf8a-1701d5d1c027</xmpMM:DocumentID>
